stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Requested
  Requested --> DriverAssigned: driver accepts
  DriverAssigned --> Requested: driver cancels (re-match)
  DriverAssigned --> DriverArrived: arrives at pickup
  DriverArrived --> InProgress: rider picked up (OTP)
  InProgress --> Completed: drop-off
  Requested --> Cancelled: rider cancels / no driver
  DriverAssigned --> Cancelled: rider cancels (fee may apply)
  DriverArrived --> Cancelled: no-show
  Completed --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
